      "claim": "A parent reports that purchased add-ons do not refund when deleted.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "I bought this morph add-on. I really don’t like it so I deleted it and it didn’t give me my mine coins back"
    },
    {
      "ref": "[R182]",
      "area": "money",
      "claim": "A parent reports being charged multiple times for the same add-on without receiving the product.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "Attempted to buy add ons like I have in the past, it wasn’t working and after the third attempt for the same product, I was charged for buying the same add on 3 times. The next day I attempted to just buy coins, only one attempt. Says it went through and never got that product either. Had to submit refund requests for the first three, and the purchase today isn’t even showing to get a refund for yet. The app is up to date. The phone is up to date. The phone has been restarted. This isn’t a problem on my end."
